            <ArticleTitle>Where Is the Breakthrough Innovation for Parasite Control?</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1471-4922(17)30278-7</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.pt.2017.11.004</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The need to improve parasite control to overcome drug-resistant parasite populations, and to improve compliance by more convenient drug application methods, is evident. While a number of incremental stepwise improvements are visible, the big disruptive innovation, an iPhone-equivalent breakthrough, has been hard to find. Why?</AbstractText>
